    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξευπορέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supply abundantly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικουρίαν ταῖς χρείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					918c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>find a way out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				861b
			</span></i>.—The form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξενπορίζω,</span> in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.6.19
			</span></i>, is prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορίζω.</span>
			</div>
